      "block_id": "2605.28896_p2_b0",
      "text": "to base models or RLHF-tuned variants in an undifferentiated way [Cunningham et al., 2023,\nGemma Scope, 2024]. The feature-level consequences of LoRA fine-tuning remain unexplored.\n",
      "bbox": [
