      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.28896_p2_b3",
      "text": "1. The delta SAE framework: We introduce a methodology for training SAEs specifically on\nadapter-induced activation deltas h\u2206= hadapted \u2212hbase, providing a mechanistically clean\ndecomposition of adapter contributions.\n",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        246.54,
        523.33,
        284.54
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        288,
        986,
        2093,
