      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 10.91,
      "font_name": "CMR10",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 217,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.28896_p2_b4",
      "text": "2. Three-measure geometric analysis: We provide convergent evidence from cosine similarity,\nprincipal angle analysis, and CKA that LoRA adapter features occupy a geometrically distinct\nsubspace from base model features.\n",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        293.66,
        524.81,
        331.67
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        288,
        1174,
        2099,
        1326
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 10.91,
      "font_name": "CMR10",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 219,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.28896_p2_b5",
      "text": "3. Systematic rank analysis: We show that rank affects feature density and CKA representa-\ntion distance, but not the fundamental geometric novelty of adapter features.\n",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        340.78,
        525.11,
        365.24
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        288,
        1363,
