      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 10.91,
      "font_name": "CMR10",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 168,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.28896_p2_b6",
      "text": "4. Safety implications: We identify a monitoring gap arising from the geometric separation of\nadapter and base features, with implications for LoRA-based alignment.\n",
      "bbox": [
